sentences.text:
In such circumstances and in the interest of justice, the sentence imposed on the applicant/first accused is suspended till the disposal of the appeal subject to the following conditions:-
i) The applicant/first accused shall be released on bail on executing a bond for 50,000/- (Rupees fifty thousand only) with two solvent sureties each for the like sum to the satisfaction of the trial court;
ii) Out of the total fine amount, he shall deposit an amount of 50,000/- within a period of one month from the date of receipt of a copy of this order.
iii) He shall not commit any offence(s) while on bail;
iv) The applicant/first accused shall not in any way contact or attempt to contact the victim or her family member(s) in any manner;
