v) If the conviction and sentence of the applicant/first accused is upheld or even modified, the time during which he is so released shall be excluded in computing the term of his sentence as provided in Section 430(4) BNSS.
vi) It is also made clear that if any of the conditions are violated, the bail shall stand cancelled.

